# Vampire Interloper: "This creature can't block." (CR 604.1). Bot2's Memnite attacks on turn 4; Bot1's untapped Interloper may not block it (refused) while its Ornithopter, in the same combat,
# can (the positive control): the Memnite is blocked and Bot1 takes no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Vampire Interloper
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x6
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vampire Interloper.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Vampire Interloper > Memnite)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Vampire Interloper; Ornithopter
